  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nIssue was reproduced using the homeservers: `tzchat.org`, `flip.earth`, `asra.gr`.\r\nTask is join to `#test:zemos.net`.\r\nRoom are sure we are joined. Room shows nicks in room users list. Client-side does not show room in room list and you can't join because gets 403 error about event.\r\n\r\nIn fact everybody who really in room are sure these users in room too, because they see their nicks in room. No way to join, because all servers are sure that users in room. I mean users that used server with this issue can't join, room admins shall kick them, but they do not know about this issue.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Have not matrix.org account\r\n2. Try to join #test:zemos.net\r\n3. You get error.\r\n4. Try again.\r\n5. You get 403 error code.\r\n\r\n### Homeserver\r\n\r\nvarious\r\n\r\n### Synapse Version\r\n\r\nany\r\n\r\n### Installation Method\r\n\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Workers\r\n\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Platform\r\n\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n```shell\r\nnot provided\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\r\n\r\n_No response_",
